# More guild chat (kind guild), by the guild's charter (@topic); "general" fits any guild. Plans, help,
# crafting, jokes and real-life breaks. Lines ask and suggest; they never promise what a guildmate will do.
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).

# ---------------- Leveling guilds ----------------
@kind guild
@topic leveling
@who *
anyone want to duo for a bit? {level} {class}
who needs xp tonight? lets get a guild group going
tips for {camp}? never been
any healers around {level} want to group up?
does anyone still need the {dungeon} quest?
anyone know what the next good camp after {camp} is?
@needs xp_high
{bubbles} bubbles in, so close i can taste it
@needs xp_mid
halfway through the level, the middle bubbles drag
@needs xp_low
fresh level, empty bar, here we go again
@needs just_leveled
ding! {level}, finally
@needs in_group
in a pickup group, nice people so far
@needs solo,outdoors
soloing in {zone}, shout if you want company
@needs

